37644>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37647>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37648>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37649>>>
37649>>>        Case Begin
37649>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37651>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37651>>>                Case Break
37652>>>
37652>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37655>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37655>>>                Case Break
